>>__ Parse.temp_set_grammars $ valOf $ grammarDB {thyname="hol"};
## `run_family`

``` hol4
benchLib.run_family :
  {family : string, goals : benchLib.corpus_goal list,
   shortfalls : benchLib.shortfall list, budget : Time.time,
   battery : benchLib.tactic_id list, level : int} ->
  benchLib.family_result
```

------------------------------------------------------------------------

Runs each selected corpus goal with its mapped tactic and checks exact
two-way agreement with the dated shortfall register.  Level 1 selects the
declared representative slice.  Level 2 runs the full supplied family and
records, but does not gate on, the requested tactic battery.

Self-analogue exclusions are checked before execution.  A newly solved
registered goal is an error just like an unregistered failure.
